{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Mentalaba AI intent configi — intent'larni kodga tegmasdan boshqarish (BOSQICH 4).",
    "howToAdd": "Yangi intent qo'shish: 1) object'ga yangi kalit qo'shing (tartib MUHIM — oldingi intent'lar avval tekshiriladi). 2) 'patterns' — regex stringlar (\\s, \\b, \\w — JSON'da ikkilangan backslash bilan!). 3) 'keywords' — oddiy so'zlar, avtomatik \\bso'z\\b regex'iga aylanadi. 4) 'handler' — tool-router'dagi dispatch kaliti (search_university, search_direction, list_directions, search_grants, search_news, search_tuition, compare_universities, recommend, get_admission, get_transfer, none). 5) 'tool' — javob formatlashda ishlatiladigan tool nomi. 6) dataIntent=true — data bo'lmasa template fallback (AI hallucination oldini oladi). 7) responseStrategy — javob qanday yaratiladi: \"template\" (0 token), \"llm\" (reasoning), \"hybrid\" (API data + LLM tahlil). Default: dataIntent=true → template, aks holda llm. Eski aiIntent=true → llm ga teng. 8) selfComplete=true — follow-up konteksti qo'shilmaydi (katalog/self-contained so'rovlar).",
    "orderNote": "Kalit tartibi klassifikatsiya tartibi — aniqroq intent'lar (comparison, tuition_search, list'lar) umumiyroqlardan OLDIN keladi!"
  },
